sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Admin as Administrator
    participant UI as Admin Blog Review Console
    participant Ctrl as AdminBlogController
    participant Svc as BlogPostService
    participant AuditSvc as AuditLogService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL 16

    Note over Admin,DB: A-09: Quan tri vien kiem duyet hang doi, phe duyet xuat ban hoac tu choi kem gop y (BR-ADM-05, BR-ADM-08)

    Admin->>UI: Mo danh sach bai cho duyet /admin/blogs
    UI->>Ctrl: GET /api/v1/admin/blogs/pending?sort=oldest&page=1
    Ctrl->>Svc: ListQueueAsync(search, sort, page, pageSize)
    Svc->>DB: SELECT blog_posts JOIN users WHERE status = PendingApproval ORDER BY submitted_at ASC
    Ctrl-->>UI: 200 OK BlogPagedResult (Queue danh sach cho duyet)

    Admin->>UI: Bam vao bai viet xem chi tiet noi dung & anh bia
    UI->>Ctrl: GET /api/v1/admin/blogs/{postId}
    Ctrl->>Svc: GetForReviewAsync(postId)
    Ctrl-->>UI: 200 OK BlogPostDto (Content day du + Tags)

    alt Admin Phe duyet & Xuat ban
        Admin->>UI: Nhan Duyet & Xuat ban
        UI->>Ctrl: PATCH /api/v1/admin/blogs/{postId}/review { action: "Approve" }
        Ctrl->>Svc: ApproveAsync(adminId, postId)
        Svc->>DB: BeginTransaction -> UPDATE Status = Approved, ApprovedByAdminId, PublishedAt = NOW() WHERE Status = PendingApproval
        alt affected == 0 (Staff da thu hoi hoac Admin khac da xu ly)
            Svc-->>Ctrl: BusinessRuleException (BR-ADM-08, MSG-GEN-01)
        else Cap nhat thanh cong
            Svc->>DB: INSERT notifications (gui Staff tac gia: "Bai viet da duoc duyet")
            Svc->>AuditSvc: LogAsync("BLOG_APPROVE", oldValues, newValues)
            Svc->>DB: Commit Transaction
            Ctrl-->>UI: 200 OK MSG-ADM-05 (Status = Approved)
        end
    else Admin Tu choi kem gop y bat buoc
        Admin->>UI: Nhap gop y chinh sua & bam Tu choi
        UI->>Ctrl: PATCH /api/v1/admin/blogs/{postId}/review { action: "Reject", feedback }
        Ctrl->>Svc: RejectAsync(adminId, postId, feedback)
        alt Feedback rong / chi co khoang trang
            Svc-->>Ctrl: BusinessRuleException (BR-ADM-08, MSG-AUTH-02)
        else Feedback hop le
            Svc->>DB: BeginTransaction -> UPDATE Status = Draft, RejectionReason = feedback, SubmittedAt = NULL
            Svc->>DB: INSERT notifications (gui Staff tac gia kem noi dung gop y)
            Svc->>AuditSvc: LogAsync("BLOG_REJECT", reason = feedback)
            Svc->>DB: Commit Transaction
            Ctrl-->>UI: 200 OK (Status = Draft, CanEdit = true)
        end
    end
